## SQLAlchemy Modelleri

### Temel Kurallar
- Tüm modeller `Base = DeclarativeBase()` sınıfından türer
- Primary key: `id: Mapped[int] = mapped_column(primary_key=True)`
- Timestamp: `created_at: Mapped[datetime] = mapped_column(server_default=func.now())`
- Tüm foreign key'ler için `ondelete="CASCADE"` belirt
- `__tablename__` her modelde açıkça tanımlanmalı

```python
# models/metric.py örneği
from sqlalchemy.orm import Mapped, mapped_column, relationship
from sqlalchemy import ForeignKey, Float, Integer, TIMESTAMP
from app.database import Base
from datetime import datetime

class Metric(Base):
    __tablename__ = "metrics"

    id: Mapped[int] = mapped_column(primary_key=True)
    server_id: Mapped[int] = mapped_column(ForeignKey("servers.id", ondelete="CASCADE"))
    cpu_percent: Mapped[float]
    ram_percent: Mapped[float]
    disk_percent: Mapped[float]          # En yüksek dolan partition
    network_in_bytes: Mapped[float]
    network_out_bytes: Mapped[float]
    load_avg_1: Mapped[float]
    load_avg_5: Mapped[float]
    load_avg_15: Mapped[float]
    raw_json: Mapped[dict] = mapped_column(postgresql.JSONB)  # Tam payload saklanır
    recorded_at: Mapped[datetime] = mapped_column(index=True)

    server: Mapped["Server"] = relationship(back_populates="metrics")
```

